<title>THAILAND: Bayer to buy out local Thai partner.</title>
<headline>Bayer to buy out local Thai partner.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemical giant Bayer AG will buy its local partner in Thailand, unlisted Thai Premier, out of a current joint venture, senior Bayer executives said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;...Bayer AG and Premier Group of companies have recently agreed to change ownership of Bayer Premier Comp into a wholly owned Bayer subsidiary,&quot; Bayer Member of the Board Dieter Becher told reporters in Bangkok.</p>
</text>
